  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 212c76d51cf5ee24f9fea25a95af92e3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TerminalInteractable
  prompt: Read terminal
  objective: {fileID: 11400000, guid: af59ad124d55f1d4399ad5e267bd2a28, type: 2}
  title: BRIEFING // UV GRID OFFLINE
  body: 'Runner, the city''s UV grid has failed and the infected are moving freely. A spare UV Power Core is sealed in this warehouse''s power vault, in the north-east corner.

    The vault lost power when the backup generator ran dry. There is spare fuel in the chained cage on the east side, and a pair of bolt cutters was left at the north end of the west catwalk.

    Cut the cage open, refuel the generator in the centre of the building, take the core, and scan it at the UV Transit Gate here in the south hall.

    Infected activity reported inside. Keep your distance.'
